    narr:narration """This position holds that the tool library's winter schedule rests on [observed Saturday-only turnout, with weekday evenings drawing four borrowers across six weeks](narr:Expr_20261015_4_Batch3Rota20261015222221_h6755674a1f17_1), and that [the Saturday shift should carry a second volunteer to run returns](narr:Expr_20261015_4_Batch3Rota20261015222221_h6755674a1f17_2). The staffing ask is phrased as a conclusion but performs a directive, so the position's support is one factual report plus one forward-looking proposal.""" ;
